Chatterbox ONNX artifact provenance

The catalog references ONNX graphs, external-data files, tokenizer data, and configuration files
from these upstream repositories:

- https://huggingface.co/KitsuMate/chatterbox-nano-v2-onnx
- https://huggingface.co/ResembleAI/chatterbox-turbo-ONNX

The catalog preserves the exact resolved upstream commit for each bundle in
catalog/bundles.json and catalog/source.json. Upstream model and tokenizer artifacts are not
included in this repository or its development ZIP. Their licenses, notices, and attribution
requirements are determined by the corresponding upstream snapshot; this NOTICE does not grant
additional rights or relicense those artifacts.

